rok 你理解下，我的这个思想什么？","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2116339476306002393"},{"author_id":"1938963008","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:16:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116338381093544444"],"id":"2116338381093544444","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":7900,"like_count":53,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":11},"text":"「中国女性更容易缺维生素D？近2万人研究给出了答案」\n\n很多人长期疲劳、腰酸背痛，就觉得是工作太累、年龄大了。其实，维生素D缺乏也是值得大家关注的因素。 https://t.co/x2AWhUfzXj","url":"https://x.com/HotmailfromSH/status/2116338381093544444"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:11:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116337301320290559"],"id":"2116337301320290559","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":5908,"like_count":54,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":8},"text":"普通人的人生有两条路：一条遵循规则，通过积累获得稳定回报；另一条面对不确定性，通过创造争取非线性回报。前者有路径，后者有规律，但成功无法复制。人与人的条件、能力和机会不同，结果必然存在差异。真正重要的不是模仿成功，而是认清位置、理解规律、独立判断。知识可以传授，经验可以借鉴，但认","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2116337301320290559"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:07:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116336346864423107"],"id":"2116336346864423107","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2372,"like_count":25,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":9},"text":"近日，安徽池州九华山云海翻涌，山峦若隐若现，宛如一幅流动的水墨长卷，美不胜收。 https://t.co/wbJ94jtjlI","url":"https://x.com/XinhuaChinese/status/2116336346864423107"},{"author_id":"3460383084","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116334339051131011"],"id":"2116334339051131011","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":5945,"like_count":53,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":7},"text":"🔥️🔥2026年10月29日，浙江台州，新车刚出4S店，还没上牌就自燃了！ https://t.co/dyI5nJNOHX","url":"https://x.com/TruthMedia123/status/2116334339051131011"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-31T00:30:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116326843104289228"],"id":"2116326843104289228","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"